{
 "title": "lend：借用并修改",
 "blocks": [
  {
   "t": "p",
   "text": "`lend` 让函数暂时借用数据并**就地修改**。修改在调用者的变量中可见。调用时不写 `lend`；但这个变量不能是 `fixed`。"
  },
  {
   "t": "code",
   "code": [
    "struct Player:",
    "    health: i32",
    "",
    "fn take_damage(p: lend Player, amount: i32):",
    "    p.health -= amount",
    "",
    "fn inc(n: lend i32):",
    "    n += 1",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    hero = Player{ health: 100 }",
    "    take_damage(hero, 25)",
    "    print(hero.health)",
    "",
    "    score = 10",
    "    inc(score)",
    "    print(score)"
   ],
   "run": true,
   "output": [
    "75",
    "11"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "text": "对拥有堆内存的类型，你甚至不需要写 `lend`：当函数体修改参数时，编译器会**自动检测出 `lend`**："
  },
  {
   "t": "code",
   "code": [
    "fn add_one(xs: List[i32]):",
    "    xs.push(1)",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    v = List[i32]()",
    "    add_one(v)",
    "    add_one(v)",
    "    print(v.len)"
   ],
   "run": true,
   "output": [
    "2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "exercise",
   "id": "c05-l02-x1",
   "prompt": "让 `reset(n: lend i32)` 把 `n` 设为 0。用 `x = 42` 调用它并输出 `x`。",
   "starter": [
    "fn reset(n: lend i32):",
    "    pass",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    x = 42",
    "    reset(x)",
    "    print(x)"
   ],
   "solution": [
    "fn reset(n: lend i32):",
    "    n = 0",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    x = 42",
    "    reset(x)",
    "    print(x)"
   ],
   "hint": "把 `pass` 换成 `n = 0`。",
   "expected": [
    "0"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "quiz",
   "id": "c05-l02-q1",
   "q": "用 `lend` 传入的变量可以是 `fixed` 吗？",
   "options": [
    "可以",
    "不可以，因为它将被修改",
    "只有当它是数字时"
   ],
   "answer": 1,
   "why": "修改一个你声明为常量的值是编译错误。"
  }
 ]
}
